{"kp_id": "zj-013.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-013", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "脑户等头后穴禁灸（易致咽伤失音），宜用针。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gv17"], "chapter_id": "zj-013.c01", "evidence_quote": "脑户和那个就这些这些这些这几个穴道通通是不揪的", "seg_from": 1, "seg_to": 2, "start_s": 5.63, "end_s": 21.91, "citation": {"youtube_id": "2_xv0PSgnGA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2_xv0PSgnGA&t=5s", "series": "zj", "episode": 13, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 13", "start_s": 5.63, "end_s": 21.91}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "不揪=不灸", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-013.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-013", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "百会为大穴，治头痛、癫疾等；前后顶辅助其功能。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gv20", "acupoint.gv19", "acupoint.gv21"], "chapter_id": "zj-013.c01", "evidence_quote": "后顶呢和前底啊这些血道都是百汇的辅助穴", "seg_from": 28, "seg_to": 65, "start_s": 177.34, "end_s": 356.425, "citation": {"youtube_id": "2_xv0PSgnGA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2_xv0PSgnGA&t=177s", "series": "zj", "episode": 13, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 13", "start_s": 177.34, "end_s": 356.43}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "前底=前顶；百汇=百会", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-013.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-013", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "头针在头皮与颅骨之间斜刺，不刺入颅腔。", "entity_ids": ["method.zhen_jiu"], "chapter_id": "zj-013.c01", "evidence_quote": "扎头针是在头皮和头骨，没有人扎进去的", "seg_from": 112, "seg_to": 112, "start_s": 579.99, "end_s": 592.555, "citation": {"youtube_id": "2_xv0PSgnGA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2_xv0PSgnGA&t=579s", "series": "zj", "episode": 13, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 13", "start_s": 579.99, "end_s": 592.55}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-013.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-013", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "头部穴多治神志精神病；近部取穴时可查书补功能，诸穴主治常相近。", "entity_ids": ["meridian.gv"], "chapter_id": "zj-013.c01", "evidence_quote": "脑部的穴道，头部的穴道大部分都是治精神方面的疾病的", "seg_from": 177, "seg_to": 182, "start_s": 966.05, "end_s": 1001.38, "citation": {"youtube_id": "2_xv0PSgnGA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2_xv0PSgnGA&t=966s", "series": "zj", "episode": 13, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 13", "start_s": 966.05, "end_s": 1001.38}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-013.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-013", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "素髎在鼻尖正中；龈交治牙龈肿烂、牙周病，口内不便灸。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gv25", "acupoint.gv28"], "chapter_id": "zj-013.c02", "evidence_quote": "鼻子正中央那个鼻头的地方就是塑料穴", "seg_from": 186, "seg_to": 236, "start_s": 1017.81, "end_s": 1293.671, "citation": {"youtube_id": "2_xv0PSgnGA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2_xv0PSgnGA&t=1017s", "series": "zj", "episode": 13, "title": "倪海厦《人纪》《针灸》全90集 之 针灸 13", "start_s": 1017.81, "end_s": 1293.67}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "塑料=素髎", "source": "llm_read"}
